{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>It shall not be inhabited.</b> The meaning: it shall not be inhabited." "<b>yhll.</b> Missing alef, like שקר מזין (Proverbs 17:4)." "<b>Arab.</b> They are the sons of Kedar, and similarly מלכי הערב (Jeremiah 25:24), משא בערב (Isaiah 21:13). The meaning: for even an Arab, whose custom is to wander from place to place, will not pitch his tents in it."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:39.049181267Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}